; bal -V --unrealized must foot to zero when a posting is dated after the
; report terminus.  Under --unrealized the terminus revaluation is the only
; one a balance report books, so it must not be skipped because the second
; purchase of 2030/01/01 follows the --now date.  Both lots are valued at
; the terminus price of $120; the report used to total $300 with no
; Equity:Unrealized Gains row.

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker        10 AAPL @ $50
    Assets:Cash

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $120

2030/01/01 Buy again
    Assets:Broker         5 AAPL @ $200
    Assets:Cash

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
                $300  Assets
               $1800    Broker
              $-1500    Cash
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -G --now 2024/04/01
                $300  Assets:Broker
end test
